flowchart TD
    A[Accelerometer] --> B[Motion score]
    C[Gyroscope] --> B
    D[Magnetometer] --> E[Heading estimate]
    F[GPS fix] --> G[Speed + position update]
    H[Barometer] --> I[Pressure-derived depth]

    B --> J[Motion confidence]
    E --> K[Heading confidence]
    G --> L[UKF correction]
    I --> M[Depth state]

    J --> N[State machine]
    K --> N
    L --> N
    M --> N

    N --> O[FIT fields\nDepth / Speed / Heading / GPS / Motion]
